{
  "schema": 1,
  "meta": {
    "name": "protect",
    "description": "Why docs/plans is immutable and how pk protect enforces it"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "id": "pk-protect",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "pk protect"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "code",
          "text": "pk protect"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " is a PreToolUse hook on Edit and Write. It denies any write under "
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "text": "docs/plans/"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", because a preserved plan is a record of what was approved, and a record that can be edited is not one."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The check resolves symlinks and compares case-insensitively on Windows, so the directory cannot be reached through an alias."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "amending-a-plan",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Amending a plan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Plans are superseded, never edited. When the approach changes, write and approve a new plan. The sequence in "
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "text": "docs/plans/"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " is the history of decisions, reversals included."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "code",
          "text": "pk protect"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " is a no-op in an unconfigured repository (no "
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "text": ".pk.json"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ")."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
